<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Stack_Types">Stack Types</span></h2><div class="hatnote"><b>Note:</b> These terms are not officially used by the game and are used by the wiki for better classification and description of their behavior.</div>
<ul><li><b>Intensity Debuffs</b> are more effective depending on how many stacks of the debuffs you have. These debuffs typically are either permanent for the combat encounter or are consumed on the following turn.</li>
<li><b>Duration Debuffs</b> last for as many turns as you have stacks of the debuff.</li>
<li><b>Counter Debuffs</b> activate when an event happens, such as playing a card.</li></ul>
<p><span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Poison" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Poison" title="Poison"><img alt="Icon Poison.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Poison.png/22px-Icon_Poison.png?628f4a" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Poison.png/33px-Icon_Poison.png?628f4a 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Poison.png/44px-Icon_Poison.png?628f4a 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Poison" title="Poison">Poison</a></span> is the ONLY Debuff with both <b>Intensity</b> and <b>Duration</b> stack types.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Counter">Counter</span></h2>
<ul><li><span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Orange Pellets" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Orange_Pellets" title="Orange Pellets"><img alt="OrangePellets.png" src="/images/thumb/OrangePellets.png/24px-OrangePellets.png?bbb2d1" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/OrangePellets.png/36px-OrangePellets.png?bbb2d1 1.5x, /images/thumb/OrangePellets.png/48px-OrangePellets.png?bbb2d1 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Orange_Pellets" title="Orange Pellets">Orange Pellets</a></span> can cleanse the player of all debuffs.</li>
<li><span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Artifact" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Artifact" title="Artifact"><img alt="Icon Artifact.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Artifact.png/22px-Icon_Artifact.png?d7c3d0" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Artifact.png/33px-Icon_Artifact.png?d7c3d0 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Artifact.png/44px-Icon_Artifact.png?d7c3d0 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Artifact" title="Artifact">Artifact</a></span> negates the application of the next debuff received.
<ul><li>Gaining <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Artifact" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Artifact" title="Artifact"><img alt="Icon Artifact.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Artifact.png/22px-Icon_Artifact.png?d7c3d0" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Artifact.png/33px-Icon_Artifact.png?d7c3d0 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Artifact.png/44px-Icon_Artifact.png?d7c3d0 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Artifact" title="Artifact">Artifact</a></span> does not interact with existing debuffs on the character.</li></ul></li></ul>
