<span data-text="watcher"><span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Crush Joints" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Crush_Joints" title="Crush Joints"><img alt="CardIcon Watcher Attack Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Watcher_Attack_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Watcher_Attack_Common.png?f67a0c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Watcher_Attack_Common.png?f67a0c 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Crush_Joints" title="Crush Joints">Crush Joints</a></span>, <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Indignation" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Indignation" title="Indignation"><img alt="CardIcon Watcher Skill Uncommon.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Watcher_Skill_Uncommon.png/24px-CardIcon_Watcher_Skill_Uncommon.png?9f496a" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Watcher_Skill_Uncommon.png?9f496a 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Indignation" title="Indignation">Indignation</a></span></span>
