<td><span data-text="ironclad"><span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Berserk" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Berserk" title="Berserk"><img alt="CardIcon Ironclad Power Rare.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Ironclad_Power_Rare.png/24px-CardIcon_Ironclad_Power_Rare.png?baa309" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Ironclad_Power_Rare.png?baa309 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Berserk" title="Berserk">Berserk</a></span></span>
</td>
<td>Receive 50% (<span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Odd Mushroom" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Odd_Mushroom" title="Odd Mushroom"><img alt="OddMushroom.png" src="/images/thumb/OddMushroom.png/24px-OddMushroom.png?387078" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/OddMushroom.png/36px-OddMushroom.png?387078 1.5x, /images/thumb/OddMushroom.png/48px-OddMushroom.png?387078 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Odd_Mushroom" title="Odd Mushroom">25%</a></span>) (<span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Paper Phrog" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Paper_Phrog" title="Paper Phrog"><img alt="PaperFrog.png" src="/images/thumb/PaperFrog.png/24px-PaperFrog.png?a89503" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/PaperFrog.png/36px-PaperFrog.png?a89503 1.5x, /images/thumb/PaperFrog.png/48px-PaperFrog.png?a89503 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Paper_Phrog" title="Paper Phrog">75%</a></span>) more damage from Attacks for X turns.
</td>
<td>
<ul><li>Applied after <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength">Strength</a></span> and <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Vigor" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Vigor" title="Vigor"><img alt="Icon Vigor.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Vigor.png/22px-Icon_Vigor.png?f2e384" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Vigor.png/33px-Icon_Vigor.png?f2e384 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Vigor.png/44px-Icon_Vigor.png?f2e384 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Vigor" title="Vigor">Vigor</a></span>, then final damage rounds down.</li>
<li>Effect can be reduced to +25% extra damage with <span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Odd Mushroom" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Odd_Mushroom" title="Odd Mushroom"><img alt="OddMushroom.png" src="/images/thumb/OddMushroom.png/24px-OddMushroom.png?387078" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/OddMushroom.png/36px-OddMushroom.png?387078 1.5x, /images/thumb/OddMushroom.png/48px-OddMushroom.png?387078 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Odd_Mushroom" title="Odd Mushroom">Odd Mushroom</a></span>.</li></ul>
</td>
