</td>
<td>Attacks deal 25% (<span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Paper Krane" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Paper_Krane" title="Paper Krane"><img alt="PaperCrane.png" src="/images/thumb/PaperCrane.png/24px-PaperCrane.png?fa0333" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/PaperCrane.png/36px-PaperCrane.png?fa0333 1.5x, /images/thumb/PaperCrane.png/48px-PaperCrane.png?fa0333 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Paper_Krane" title="Paper Krane">40%</a></span>) less damage for X turns.
</td>
<td>
<ul><li>Applied after <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength">Strength</a></span> and <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Vigor" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Vigor" title="Vigor"><img alt="Icon Vigor.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Vigor.png/22px-Icon_Vigor.png?f2e384" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Vigor.png/33px-Icon_Vigor.png?f2e384 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Vigor.png/44px-Icon_Vigor.png?f2e384 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Vigor" title="Vigor">Vigor</a></span>, then final damage rounds down.</li>
<li>Specifically negated by <span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Ginger" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Ginger" title="Ginger"><img alt="Ginger.png" src="/images/thumb/Ginger.png/24px-Ginger.png?f09682" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Ginger.png/36px-Ginger.png?f09682 1.5x, /images/thumb/Ginger.png/48px-Ginger.png?f09682 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Ginger" title="Ginger">Ginger</a></span>.</li></ul>
</td>
