<td>
</td>
<td>At the start of its turn, lose X HP, then reduce Poison by 1.
</td>
<td><span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Catalyst" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Catalyst" title="Catalyst"><img alt="CardIcon Silent Skill Uncommon.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Uncommon.png/24px-CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Uncommon.png?eaedc0" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Uncommon.png?eaedc0 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Catalyst" title="Catalyst">Catalyst</a></span> counts as a single application for <span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Snecko Skull" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Snecko_Skull" title="Snecko Skull"><img alt="SnakeSkull.png" src="/images/thumb/SnakeSkull.png/24px-SnakeSkull.png?40fc82" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/SnakeSkull.png/36px-SnakeSkull.png?40fc82 1.5x, /images/thumb/SnakeSkull.png/48px-SnakeSkull.png?40fc82 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Snecko_Skull" title="Snecko Skull">Snecko Skull</a></span> and <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Artifact" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Artifact" title="Artifact"><img alt="Icon Artifact.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Artifact.png/22px-Icon_Artifact.png?d7c3d0" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Artifact.png/33px-Icon_Artifact.png?d7c3d0 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Artifact.png/44px-Icon_Artifact.png?d7c3d0 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Artifact" title="Artifact">Artifact</a></span> interactions.
<p>(only 9999 Poison can be applied as a single instance. This is only relevant to Specimen and having more than 9999 stacks of Noxious Fumes in the base game. This is NOT relevant to Catalyst.)
</p>
</td>
<td>Intensity and Duration
</td>
