</td>
<td><span data-text="ironclad"><span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Disarm" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Disarm" title="Disarm"><img alt="CardIcon Ironclad Skill Uncommon.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Ironclad_Skill_Uncommon.png/24px-CardIcon_Ironclad_Skill_Uncommon.png?64c48d" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Ironclad_Skill_Uncommon.png?64c48d 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Disarm" title="Disarm">Disarm</a></span></span>
<p><span data-text="silent"><span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Piercing Wail" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Piercing_Wail" title="Piercing Wail"><img alt="CardIcon Silent Skill Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Common.png?711671" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Common.png?711671 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Piercing_Wail" title="Piercing Wail">Piercing Wail</a></span>, <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Malaise" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Malaise" title="Malaise"><img alt="CardIcon Silent Skill Rare.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Rare.png/24px-CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Rare.png?5a1724" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Rare.png?5a1724 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Malaise" title="Malaise">Malaise</a></span></span>
<span data-text="all"><span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Dark Shackles" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Dark_Shackles" title="Dark Shackles"><img alt="CardIcon Colorless Skill Uncommon.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Uncommon.png/24px-CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Uncommon.png?8e5796" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Uncommon.png?8e5796 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Dark_Shackles" title="Dark Shackles">Dark Shackles</a></span></span>
<span data-text="enemy"><span class="enemy-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Lagavulin" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Lagavulin#Lagavulin" title="Lagavulin"><img alt="EliteClear.png" src="/images/thumb/EliteClear.png/22px-EliteClear.png?9888cd" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/EliteClear.png/33px-EliteClear.png?9888cd 1.5x, /images/thumb/EliteClear.png/44px-EliteClear.png?9888cd 2x" data-file-width="106" data-file-height="106" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Lagavulin#Lagavulin" title="Lagavulin">Lagavulin</a></span>, <span class="enemy-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Spire Shield" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Spire_Shield_and_Spire_Spear#Spire_Shield" title="Spire Shield and Spire Spear"><img alt="EliteClear.png" src="/images/thumb/EliteClear.png/22px-EliteClear.png?9888cd" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/EliteClear.png/33px-EliteClear.png?9888cd 1.5x, /images/thumb/EliteClear.png/44px-EliteClear.png?9888cd 2x" data-file-width="106" data-file-height="106" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Spire_Shield_and_Spire_Spear#Spire_Shield" title="Spire Shield and Spire Spear">Spire Shield</a></span></span>
</p>
</td>
<td><span data-text="enemy"><span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Shifting" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Transient" title="Transient"><img alt="Icon Shifting.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Shifting.png/22px-Icon_Shifting.png?7c054b" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Shifting.png/33px-Icon_Shifting.png?7c054b 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Shifting.png/44px-Icon_Shifting.png?7c054b 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Transient" title="Transient">Shifting</a></span></span>
</td>
<td>Decreases attack damage by X.
</td>
<td>All negative <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength">Strength</a></span> can be cleansed with <span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Orange Pellets" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Orange_Pellets" title="Orange Pellets"><img alt="OrangePellets.png" src="/images/thumb/OrangePellets.png/24px-OrangePellets.png?bbb2d1" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/OrangePellets.png/36px-OrangePellets.png?bbb2d1 1.5x, /images/thumb/OrangePellets.png/48px-OrangePellets.png?bbb2d1 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Orange_Pellets" title="Orange Pellets">Orange Pellets</a></span>, resetting it to 0. <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Artifact" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Artifact" title="Artifact"><img alt="Icon Artifact.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Artifact.png/22px-Icon_Artifact.png?d7c3d0" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Artifact.png/33px-Icon_Artifact.png?d7c3d0 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Artifact.png/44px-Icon_Artifact.png?d7c3d0 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Artifact" title="Artifact">Artifact</a></span> can negate 1 instance of negative Strength.
<p><span data-text="ironclad">No ordering of Orange Pellets and healing can negate the -3 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength">Strength</a></span> inflicted by going above half hp for <span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Red Skull" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Red_Skull" title="Red Skull"><img alt="RedSkull.png" src="/images/thumb/RedSkull.png/24px-RedSkull.png?69d859" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/RedSkull.png/36px-RedSkull.png?69d859 1.5x, /images/thumb/RedSkull.png/48px-RedSkull.png?69d859 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Red_Skull" title="Red Skull">Red Skull</a></span>, however Artifact can.</span>
</p>
</td>
<td>Intensity
</td>
<td>-999 to -1
</td></tr>
<tr>
<td><div id="Shackled"><a href="/wiki/File:Icon_Shackled.png" class="image"><img alt="Icon Shackled.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Shackled.png/60px-Icon_Shackled.png?64b463" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="60" height="60" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Shackled.png/90px-Icon_Shackled.png?64b463 1.5x, /images/Icon_Shackled.png?64b463 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a></div>
</td>
<td style="text-align:center; font-weight:bold;">
<h6><span class="mw-headline" id="Shackled">Shackled</span></h6>
</td>
<td><span data-text="silent"><span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Piercing Wail" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Piercing_Wail" title="Piercing Wail"><img alt="CardIcon Silent Skill Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Common.png?711671" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Common.png?711671 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Piercing_Wail" title="Piercing Wail">Piercing Wail</a></span></span> <span data-text="all"><span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Dark Shackles" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Dark_Shackles" title="Dark Shackles"><img alt="CardIcon Colorless Skill Uncommon.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Uncommon.png/24px-CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Uncommon.png?8e5796" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Uncommon.png?8e5796 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Dark_Shackles" title="Dark Shackles">Dark Shackles</a></span></span>
</td>
<td><span data-text="enemy"><span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Shifting" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Transient" title="Transient"><img alt="Icon Shifting.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Shifting.png/22px-Icon_Shifting.png?7c054b" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Shifting.png/33px-Icon_Shifting.png?7c054b 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Shifting.png/44px-Icon_Shifting.png?7c054b 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Transient" title="Transient">Shifting</a></span></span>
</td>
<td>At the end of its turn, gains X Strength.
</td>
<td>Buff coded as a debuff. As a result, using <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Piercing Wail" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Piercing_Wail" title="Piercing Wail"><img alt="CardIcon Silent Skill Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Common.png?711671" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Common.png?711671 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Piercing_Wail" title="Piercing Wail">Piercing Wail</a></span> or <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Dark Shackles" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Dark_Shackles" title="Dark Shackles"><img alt="CardIcon Colorless Skill Uncommon.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Uncommon.png/24px-CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Uncommon.png?8e5796" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Uncommon.png?8e5796 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Dark_Shackles" title="Dark Shackles">Dark Shackles</a></span> on the turn the <a href="/wiki/Corrupt_Heart" title="Corrupt Heart">Corrupt Heart</a> cleanses negative <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength">Strength</a></span> will cause it to gain X <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength">Strength</a></span>. And using them on the turn <a href="/wiki/Time_Eater" title="Time Eater">Time Eater</a>, <a href="/wiki/Awakened_One" title="Awakened One">Awakened One</a> and <a href="/wiki/The_Champ" title="The Champ">The Champ</a> removes debuffs, makes the strength loss permanent.
<p>Playing <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Piercing Wail" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Piercing_Wail" title="Piercing Wail"><img alt="CardIcon Silent Skill Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Common.png?711671" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Common.png?711671 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Piercing_Wail" title="Piercing Wail">Piercing Wail</a></span> or <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Dark Shackles" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Dark_Shackles" title="Dark Shackles"><img alt="CardIcon Colorless Skill Uncommon.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Uncommon.png/24px-CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Uncommon.png?8e5796" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Uncommon.png?8e5796 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Dark_Shackles" title="Dark Shackles">Dark Shackles</a></span> on an Enemy with <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Artifact" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Artifact" title="Artifact"><img alt="Icon Artifact.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Artifact.png/22px-Icon_Artifact.png?d7c3d0" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Artifact.png/33px-Icon_Artifact.png?d7c3d0 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Artifact.png/44px-Icon_Artifact.png?d7c3d0 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Artifact" title="Artifact">Artifact</a></span> will cause it to only lose 1 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Artifact" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Artifact" title="Artifact"><img alt="Icon Artifact.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Artifact.png/22px-Icon_Artifact.png?d7c3d0" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Artifact.png/33px-Icon_Artifact.png?d7c3d0 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Artifact.png/44px-Icon_Artifact.png?d7c3d0 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Artifact" title="Artifact">Artifact</a></span>, despite being 2 Debuffs. 
</p>
</td>
<td>Intensity
</td>
<td>0 to 999
</td></tr>
