</td>
<td><span data-text="all"><span class="inline-trigger potion-trigger" data-name="Speed Potion" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/File:SpeedPotion.png" class="image"><img alt="SpeedPotion.png" src="/images/thumb/SpeedPotion.png/24px-SpeedPotion.png?f82474" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/SpeedPotion.png/36px-SpeedPotion.png?f82474 1.5x, /images/thumb/SpeedPotion.png/48px-SpeedPotion.png?f82474 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Speed_Potion" title="Speed Potion">Speed Potion</a></span>, <span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Duality" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Duality" title="Duality"><img alt="Duality.png" src="/images/thumb/Duality.png/24px-Duality.png?91f1da" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Duality.png/36px-Duality.png?91f1da 1.5x, /images/thumb/Duality.png/48px-Duality.png?91f1da 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Duality" title="Duality">Duality</a></span></span>
<p><span data-show="all" style="display:none"></span>
</p>
