<td><span data-text="silent"><span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Wraith Form" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Wraith_Form" title="Wraith Form"><img alt="Icon WraithForm.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_WraithForm.png/22px-Icon_WraithForm.png?deb719" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="21" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_WraithForm.png/33px-Icon_WraithForm.png?deb719 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_WraithForm.png/44px-Icon_WraithForm.png?deb719 2x" data-file-width="102" data-file-height="96" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Wraith_Form" title="Wraith Form">Wraith Form</a></span></span>
