<td>Negative <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Focus" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Orbs" title="Orbs"><img alt="Icon Focus.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Focus.png/22px-Icon_Focus.png?abc930" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Focus.png/33px-Icon_Focus.png?abc930 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Focus.png/44px-Icon_Focus.png?abc930 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Orbs" title="Orbs">Focus</a></span> can be cleansed with <span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Orange Pellets" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Orange_Pellets" title="Orange Pellets"><img alt="OrangePellets.png" src="/images/thumb/OrangePellets.png/24px-OrangePellets.png?bbb2d1" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/OrangePellets.png/36px-OrangePellets.png?bbb2d1 1.5x, /images/thumb/OrangePellets.png/48px-OrangePellets.png?bbb2d1 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Orange_Pellets" title="Orange Pellets">Orange Pellets</a></span>, resetting it to 0. <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Artifact" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Artifact" title="Artifact"><img alt="Icon Artifact.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Artifact.png/22px-Icon_Artifact.png?d7c3d0" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Artifact.png/33px-Icon_Artifact.png?d7c3d0 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Artifact.png/44px-Icon_Artifact.png?d7c3d0 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Artifact" title="Artifact">Artifact</a></span> can negate 1 instance of negative Focus.
<ul><li><span class="enemy-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Spire Shield" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Spire_Shield_and_Spire_Spear#Spire_Shield" title="Spire Shield and Spire Spear"><img alt="EliteClear.png" src="/images/thumb/EliteClear.png/22px-EliteClear.png?9888cd" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/EliteClear.png/33px-EliteClear.png?9888cd 1.5x, /images/thumb/EliteClear.png/44px-EliteClear.png?9888cd 2x" data-file-width="106" data-file-height="106" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Spire_Shield_and_Spire_Spear#Spire_Shield" title="Spire Shield and Spire Spear">Spire Shield</a></span> only has a chance of applying if Player has an <a href="/wiki/Orb" class="mw-redirect" title="Orb">Orb</a> Slot.</li></ul>
</td>
