<td><span data-text="all"><span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Snecko Eye" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Snecko_Eye" title="Snecko Eye"><img alt="SneckoEye.png" src="/images/thumb/SneckoEye.png/24px-SneckoEye.png?9be98a" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/SneckoEye.png/36px-SneckoEye.png?9be98a 1.5x, /images/thumb/SneckoEye.png/48px-SneckoEye.png?9be98a 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Snecko_Eye" title="Snecko Eye">Snecko Eye</a></span></span>
</td>
<td>Whenever you draw a card, randomize its cost.
</td>
<td>Only drawing into the card changes its cost (0–3). Fetching it with effects like <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Seek" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Seek" title="Seek"><img alt="CardIcon Defect Skill Rare.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Defect_Skill_Rare.png/24px-CardIcon_Defect_Skill_Rare.png?abdc6f" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Defect_Skill_Rare.png?abdc6f 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Seek" title="Seek">Seek</a></span> keeps its current cost.
<p><span data-text="all"><span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Confused" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Snecko_Eye" title="Snecko Eye"><img alt="Icon Confused.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Confused.png/22px-Icon_Confused.png?dc64fa" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="20" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Confused.png/33px-Icon_Confused.png?dc64fa 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Confused.png/44px-Icon_Confused.png?dc64fa 2x" data-file-width="88" data-file-height="81" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Snecko_Eye" title="Snecko Eye">Confusion</a></span> from <span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Snecko Eye" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Snecko_Eye" title="Snecko Eye"><img alt="SneckoEye.png" src="/images/thumb/SneckoEye.png/24px-SneckoEye.png?9be98a" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/SneckoEye.png/36px-SneckoEye.png?9be98a 1.5x, /images/thumb/SneckoEye.png/48px-SneckoEye.png?9be98a 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Snecko_Eye" title="Snecko Eye">Snecko Eye</a></span> is applied at the start of combat and cannot negated by any <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Artifact" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Artifact" title="Artifact"><img alt="Icon Artifact.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Artifact.png/22px-Icon_Artifact.png?d7c3d0" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Artifact.png/33px-Icon_Artifact.png?d7c3d0 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Artifact.png/44px-Icon_Artifact.png?d7c3d0 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Artifact" title="Artifact">Artifact</a></span>, including from <span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Clockwork Souvenir" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Clockwork_Souvenir" title="Clockwork Souvenir"><img alt="ClockworkSouvenir.png" src="/images/thumb/ClockworkSouvenir.png/24px-ClockworkSouvenir.png?8a3c8b" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/ClockworkSouvenir.png/36px-ClockworkSouvenir.png?8a3c8b 1.5x, /images/thumb/ClockworkSouvenir.png/48px-ClockworkSouvenir.png?8a3c8b 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Clockwork_Souvenir" title="Clockwork Souvenir">Clockwork Souvenir</a></span>.</span>
</p>
</td>
