</td>
<td><span data-text="watcher"><span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Talk to the Hand" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Talk_to_the_Hand" title="Talk to the Hand"><img alt="CardIcon Watcher Attack Uncommon.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Watcher_Attack_Uncommon.png/24px-CardIcon_Watcher_Attack_Uncommon.png?f6d4a0" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Watcher_Attack_Uncommon.png?f6d4a0 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Talk_to_the_Hand" title="Talk to the Hand">Talk to the Hand</a></span></span>
<p><span data-show="watcher" style="display:none"></span>
</p>
</td>
<td>
</td>
<td>Whenever you attack this enemy, gain X <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Block" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><img alt="Icon Block.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/18px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/27px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/36px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><span title="">Block</span></a></span>.
</td>
<td>
</td>
<td>Intensity
</td>
<td>Integer limit
</td></tr>
<tr>
<td><div id="Fasting"><a href="/wiki/File:Icon_Fasting.png" class="image"><img alt="Icon Fasting.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Fasting.png/60px-Icon_Fasting.png?ae716a" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="60" height="60" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Fasting.png/90px-Icon_Fasting.png?ae716a 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Fasting.png/120px-Icon_Fasting.png?ae716a 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a></div>
</td>
<td style="text-align:center; font-weight:bold;">
<h6><span class="mw-headline" id="Fasting">Fasting</span></h6>
</td>
<td>
</td>
<td><span data-text="watcher"><span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Fasting" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Fasting" title="Fasting"><img alt="CardIcon Watcher Power Uncommon.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Watcher_Power_Uncommon.png/24px-CardIcon_Watcher_Power_Uncommon.png?ca32e5" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Watcher_Power_Uncommon.png?ca32e5 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Fasting" title="Fasting">Fasting</a></span></span>
<p><span data-show="watcher" style="display:none"></span>
</p>
</td>
