<td><span data-text="watcher"><span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Pressure Points" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Pressure_Points" title="Pressure Points"><img alt="CardIcon Watcher Skill Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Watcher_Skill_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Watcher_Skill_Common.png?b56679" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Watcher_Skill_Common.png?b56679 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Pressure_Points" title="Pressure Points">Pressure Points</a></span></span>
<p><span data-show="watcher" style="display:none"></span>
</p>
</td>
<td>
</td>
<td>Whenever you play <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Pressure Points" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Pressure_Points" title="Pressure Points"><img alt="CardIcon Watcher Skill Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Watcher_Skill_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Watcher_Skill_Common.png?b56679" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Watcher_Skill_Common.png?b56679 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Pressure_Points" title="Pressure Points">Pressure Points</a></span>, all enemies with <b>Mark</b> lose X HP.
</td>
<td>
</td>
<td>Intensity
</td>
<td>Integer limit
</td></tr>
<tr>
<td><div id="No&#95;Block"><a href="/wiki/File:Icon_NoBlock.png" class="image"><img alt="Icon NoBlock.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_NoBlock.png/60px-Icon_NoBlock.png?255251" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="60" height="60" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_NoBlock.png/90px-Icon_NoBlock.png?255251 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_NoBlock.png/120px-Icon_NoBlock.png?255251 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a></div>
</td>
<td style="text-align:center; font-weight:bold;">
<h6><span class="mw-headline" id="No_Block">No Block</span></h6>
</td>
<td>
</td>
<td><span data-text="all"><span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Panic Button" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Panic_Button" title="Panic Button"><img alt="CardIcon Colorless Skill Uncommon.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Uncommon.png/24px-CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Uncommon.png?8e5796" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Uncommon.png?8e5796 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Panic_Button" title="Panic Button">Panic Button</a></span></span>
<p><span data-show="all" style="display:none"></span>
</p>
</td>
<td>You cannot gain <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Block" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><img alt="Icon Block.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/18px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/27px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/36px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><span title="">Block</span></a></span> from cards for the next X turns.
