<p><span data-show="enemy" style="display:none"></span>
</p>
</td>
<td>Whenever you play a card, the target receives 10% more damage from Attacks this turn.
</td>
<td>X is carried over on the continued turn after Vault is played. While it caps at the integer limit,	the attack damage overflows to -1 long before Slow reaches it. This -1 damage deals no damage.
</td>
